                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "33552f15-9222-4e1c-8fce-20c92ed2de5b",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "Sometimes the thirst for pleasure predominates, then the wish to grow preponders. Back and forth we struggle, from dearth to sterility."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f1bc793a-84f4-4041-aaca-7b182e070721",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "The gurgling sound of the falls preponders the air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0cdb6ee-410b-41dd-8877-c2dad0e6022a",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "However, research preponders towards practical applications, for example, evaluation of two advertising appeals."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a497e08-9000-4215-9e7e-67148c21c178",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "As the democrat preponders over the aristocrat, so oxygen prevails over iron, the power of gravity is as much greater than that of magnetism, as regular democracy is superior to haphazard aristocracy ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df156895-8e64-407b-9f87-18e582beba56",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "As it is, the embellishments preponder over constructive ability, and one sadly reflects here, more than anywhere else, how small in great, and how great in small, things the Japanese really are."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b563be02-58cc-47c3-a219-5e19f35b9c13",
                                "sense_id": "c0840869-c52f-3d68-a481-3739abdaa3cd",
                                "text": "Plaintiff has the burden of presenting a case which fairly preponders over the defendant's case."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
